  "notes": "Bulletin dated 1997-09-30, group 1013. Page 2 specifies six long jets for Turbo. Existing bore depth is not to be reworked. The parts table gives 21.5 mm for the short jet 964 101 020 00 and its oversize 964 101 020 50; the PET (Kat 017 page 35) prints 22,5 MM for both. Unresolved, deferred as CTR-0018; the long jet, 33.5 mm, agrees."
